<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Algorithmic Capture as a Control System}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\section{Stateâ€“Control Formulation}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Define the cognitive state and control input:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{align}
\mathbf{x}(t) &amp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;\begin{bmatrix}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\Phi(x,t) \
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\mathbf{v}(x,t)
&nbsp;&nbsp;\end{bmatrix}, &amp;
\mathbf{u}(t) &amp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;\begin{bmatrix}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\beta(x,t) \
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\gamma(x,t)
&nbsp;&nbsp;\end{bmatrix}
\end{align}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">where:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Î²</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05278em;">Î²</span></span></span></span> is algorithmic steerage pressure (semantic compression),</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Î³</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">Î³</span></span></span></span> is attention damping (agency dissipation).</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The controlled RSVP dynamics become:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{align}
\partial_t \Phi &amp;= D_\Phi \nabla^2 \Phi - \beta , \Phi + \nabla\cdot \mathbf{v} \
\partial_t \mathbf{v} &amp;= D_v \nabla^2 \mathbf{v} + \nabla \Phi - \gamma \mathbf{v}
\end{align}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Compactly:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">x</mi><mo>Ë™</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant="bold">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant="bold">u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot{\mathbf{x}} = A \mathbf{x} + B \mathbf{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6813em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6813em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">x</span></span><span style="top: -3.0134em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.1111em;"><span class="mord">Ë™</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mord mathbf">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05017em;">B</span><span class="mord mathbf">u</span></span></span></span></span>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">with:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0.16em" columnalign="center center" columnspacing="1em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mo>â‹…</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0.16em" columnalign="center center" columnspacing="1em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mrow><mo>âˆ’</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mrow><mo>âˆ’</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A =
