<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\section{Capture Objective Functional}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Define algorithmic capture as entropy harvesting:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>âˆ«</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msub><mo>âˆ«</mo><mi mathvariant="script">M</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><mi>Î²</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Î³</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>âˆ’</mo><msub><mi>Î»</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>âˆ’</mo><msub><mi>Î»</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mo>Ã—</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>Î¼</mi><mtext>â€‰</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\text{cap}} =
\int_0^T \int_{\mathcal{M}}
\left[
\beta \Phi + 
\gamma \|\mathbf{v}\|^2 -
\lambda_1 \|\nabla \Phi\|^2 -
