<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Empirical proxies for <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> include:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{itemize}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\item Variance of next-token predictive distributions in population-scale language traces
