<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Training Objectives That Preserve Semantic Gradient}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Loss functions that shrink uncertainty will also shrink futures.''}{R. K. Malhotra (formalized)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Define the semantic gradient preservation objective:</p>
