<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Attention Topology and Agency Conservation}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Attention is a vector field; belief is its divergence.''}{S. Radhakrishnan (vectorized)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">In attentionâ€“based models, the induced agency flow is:</p>
