<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``To think is to climb.''}{G. Bachelard (topologized)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Healthy cognition performs gradient ascent on semantic potential:</p>
