<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Define the LM-induced evolution operator:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">L</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="double-struck">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>Î¸</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>âˆ’</mo><mi>Î·</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ‡</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Î¦</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">âˆ¥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}[\Phi] = \mathbb{E}_{p_\theta(x)}[\Phi(x)] - \eta \|\nabla \Phi(x)\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">L</span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">Î¦</span><span class="mclose">]</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1052em; vertical-align: -0.3552em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbb">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3448em;"><span style="top: -2.5198em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist