<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Collapse as a Civilizational Phase Transition}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Civilizations do not fall, they flatten.''}{E. Anders (topological restatement)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Let the civilizational order parameter be the mean semantic gradient:</p>
