<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Culture is the flywheel of curvature.''}{L. Nguyen (mechanical analogy)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Let cultural production inject semantic energy:</p>
